bklit-tanstack-charts

This package is a port of bklit-ui's chart components onto TanStack Charts.
Component APIs, visual design and interaction behaviour originate from:

  bklit-ui (https://github.com/bklit/bklit-ui)
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 uixmat

The charts render with, and require as a peer dependency:

  TanStack Charts (@tanstack/charts, @tanstack/react-charts)
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026-present Tanner Linsley

